OL,3,GNEWSAResidents evacuated from homes in
OL,4,ABallymena security alert
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents have been evacuated from two
OL,7,Fhomes in a security alert in Ballymena,
OL,8,FCounty Antrim.
OL,10,FPolice are at the scene in the
OL,11,FMoorfields Road area of the town.
OL,13,FMembers of the public, including
OL,14,Fdrivers, are being advised to avoid the
OL,15,Farea.
OL,17,FCordons are in place.
